            <profile id="d41f-388c-e7b2-f372" name="Equipment and options (as printed in WAB2 army list)" publicationId="fcb9-17be-94c2-bcfc" hidden="false" typeId="b19e-ee0c-17d1-6e33" typeName="Equipment and Notes">
              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Text" typeId="63ac-8f60-d28a-2232">Household Cavalry have a hand weapon, light armour, composite bow and shield. Shock Cavalry. Veteran. May have heavy armour (+1), thrusting spear (+3) and cloth barding (+3). They may be Stubborn (+3). Household cavalry models may not outnumber Turcoman cavalry models.</characteristic>
              </characteristics>
            </profile>
